This repository is a bilingual (Chinese / English) algorithm course built in the Learning Clustering house style.

- Follow `course-playbook/SKILL.md` as standing instructions.
- Before working on an area, read its reference: anatomy `reference/01`, volume `02`, films `03`,
  design and i18n `04`, workflow `05`, tests `06`, pitfalls `07` (all under `course-playbook/`).
- Use the step prompts in `course-playbook/prompts/` and the checklists in `course-playbook/checklists/`.
- Engine first: every number shown to learners comes from the course engine; films assert their numbers.
- One module at a time, to full depth. Keep `handoff-state.md` current. Run the tests before finishing.
